<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Tuesday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting moderate inquiry.</p>
<p>There were 20,700 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 10,800 head of formulated cattle, 100 head previously contracted and 1,500 head or 41 loads of CME cattle delivered to area packing plants.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
